<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Student Notice Board</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #fff8e7;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .board {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .notice {
            padding: 18px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: #fafafa;
        }

        .date {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .important {
            border-left: 6px solid #555;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="board">

    <h1>📌 Student Notice Board</h1>

    <div class="notice important">

        <div class="date">📅 9 September 2026</div>

        <h2>Computer Science Practical</h2>

        <p>
            Students are requested to bring their practical notebooks
            for the upcoming computer laboratory session.
        </p>

    </div>

    <div class="notice">

        <div class="date">📅 11 September 2026</div>

        <h2>Assignment Submission</h2>

        <p>
            Students should check their pending assignments and
            submit them according to the instructions provided by
            their teachers.
        </p>

    </div>

    <div class="notice">

        <div class="date">📅 15 September 2026</div>

        <h2>Student Activity</h2>

        <p>
            An educational activity will be organized for students.
            More information will be shared in class.
        </p>

    </div>

    <div class="notice">

        <div class="date">📅 20 September 2026</div>

        <h2>Library Reminder</h2>

        <p>
            Students are requested to return borrowed library books
            according to the library schedule.
        </p>

    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
